#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCategoriesSection.php:351
msgid "Deleted category"
msgstr "Slettet kategori"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCategoriesSection.php:213
msgid "The category no longer exists, so this mapping links no products. Remove it to free the creator's category."
msgstr "Kategorien findes ikke længere, så denne mapping tilknytter ingen produkter. Fjern den for at frigøre creatorens kategori."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCategoriesSection.php:222
msgid "Remove…"
msgstr "Fjern…"

