msgid "Map a product category"
msgstr "Map en produktkategori"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorCategoriesSection.php:238
msgid "Only active creators can get a product category."
msgstr "Kun aktive creators kan få en produktkategori."

